{%- comment -%}
  =============================================================================
  FONT PAIRING LOADER — call site contract
  =============================================================================
  • This snippet MUST be rendered only once, inside <head> in layout/theme.liquid.
    It is the single permitted entry point for loading curated (Google Fonts) pairings.

  • snippets/font-pairing-link.liquid MUST be called only from this file, in the loop
    below. Never render font-pairing-link from a section, another snippet, or the body:
    stylesheet <link> in <body> is invalid HTML and causes FOUC.

  • Order matters: output the two preconnect <link>s first, then the stylesheet links.
    Preconnect after a stylesheet request has no effect.

  • fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com are on Shopify’s theme CSP allowlist for
    Google Fonts — no extra layout/content_security_policy.liquid needed while URLs
    stay on those hosts. If you change the font CDN (Adobe, Bunny, self-hosted, etc.),
    add the host to layout/content_security_policy.liquid per Shopify docs; a <link>
    alone is not sufficient.

  Preset mode: three Google Font bundles (neutral, vision, technology). Custom: Shopify font_face in css-variables.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.typography_mode != 'custom' -%}
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  {%- liquid
    assign all_pairings = 'neutral|vision|technology' | split: '|'
    for pairing in all_pairings
      render 'font-pairing-link', pairing: pairing
    endfor
  -%}
{%- endif -%}
